      "type": "data_flow",
      "value": "`efSync_Spawn` initializes `efLib_LoadKind` to asynchronous and `efLib_AnimCount` to zero, then changes the load kind to synchronous for locally handled effect recipes. `efLib_Create` reads the load kind to decide whether to enforce the 64-effect limit and increment `efLib_EffectCount`, and copies the load kind into the new effect's `is_async` field. `efLib_Init` resets the effect count, while the alternate dispatch epilogue decrements `efLib_AnimCount` and uses each resulting index to animate an entry from `efLib_AnimQueue`.",
      "disposition": "unresolved",
      "reason": "Typed global consumers are verified and described at file scope, but complete section mapping is not independently verified.",
